 "marks": [
  {
   "d": "2022-03-02",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "In total, trading has been in line with the Board's expectations since the Company's last guidance issued on 28 September 2021.",
   "file": "20220302_SSTY_Conclusion-of-Strategic-Review.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-06-29",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Revenues for the first quarter of 2022 were slightly ahead of management's prudent expectations. The Board confirms that overall trading across the Group since the year end remains in line with its expectations.",
   "file": "20220629_SSTY_Notice-of-Results-and-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-29",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Company is pleased to report that the operational and financial performance of the business continues to be in line with the update provided on 29 June 2022 and t he Board confirms that overall trading across the Group since the year end remains in line with its expectations.",
   "file": "20220729_SSTY_Extension-to-Publication-of-FY-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-08-15",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The first five months of 2022, indicate Group trading is continuing to improve, in line with increasing demand and that bookings for the summer are in-line with management's expectations.",
   "file": "20220815_SSTY_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-29",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "It is important to remain cautious, especially given the current economic backdrop, but the business is well funded, demand is rising and we are well placed to deliver a trading result for the year that is comfortably ahead of our expectations at the outset of 2022.",
   "file": "20220929_SSTY_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-28",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Adjusted EBITDA is expected to be in line with market expectations of £5.9 million (2021: Loss of £1.0 million).",
   "file": "20230228_SSTY_Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-06-09",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "The current year has started strongly, with trading in the first four months significantly ahead of budget, and this together with careful revenue management and increased occupancy should result in a good outcome for this year.",
   "file": "20230609_SSTY_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-26",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Good demand continued into the key summer months of July and August during which the Group achieved occupancy levels of 85%. Overall, the Group is comfortably placed to achieve market expectations for the current year.",
   "file": "20230926_SSTY_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-01-29",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Safestay (AIM: SSTY), the owner and operator of an international brand of contemporary hostels, is pleased to announce that trading for the 12 months to 31 December 2023, is expected to be comfortably in line with market expectations*.",
   "file": "20240129_SSTY_Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-06-07",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The pipeline for 2024 is extremely promising with forward sales at the beginning of the year significantly ahead of the level of the previous year.",
   "file": "20240607_SSTY_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-09-05",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Forward bookings for the remainder of 2024 and into 2025 are comfortably ahead of the prior year supported by a continuing recovery in group bookings. As a result of the Group's progress in H1 and its trading momentum the Board anticipates delivering further profitable growth in H2",
   "file": "20240905_SSTY_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-02-03",
