   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "Since the release of that announcement, the Company announces that the challenging trading conditions and price pressures have continued. Against this backdrop, the Board continues to focus on maintaining occupancy rates and controlling costs.",
